<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>You're invited to join Fileam</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        html, body { width: 100% !important; margin: 0; padding: 0; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; overflow-x: hidden; }
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; background-color: #f5f5f5; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.6; padding: 16px; }
        .container { max-width: 560px; width: 100% !important; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); overflow: hidden; }
        .header { background-color: #ffffff; padding: 32px 24px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef; }
        .logo { display: block; margin: 0 auto 16px; max-height: 48px; max-width: 100%; width: auto; height: auto; }
        .header-subtitle { font-size: 15px; color: #6c757d; font-weight: 400; }
        .content { padding: 32px 24px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a1a1a; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .message { font-size: 15px; color: #4a4a4a; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.65; word-wrap: break-word; }
        .code-container { background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 16px; text-align: center; margin: 24px 0; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; max-width: 100%; overflow: hidden; }
        .code-label { font-size: 12px; color: #6c757d; margin-bottom: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; font-weight: 600; }
        .code-value { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; color: #1a1a1a; letter-spacing: 0.25em; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; background: #fff; padding: 16px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 2px solid #008b8b; text-align: center; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: anywhere; line-height: 1.35; }
        .expiry-info { background-color: #fff8e6; border: 1px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; margin: 20px 0; text-align: center; }
        .expiry-text { color: #92400e; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
        .cta-note { background-color: #e6f7f7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin: 20px 0; border-left: 4px solid #008b8b; }
        .cta-note .security-text { color: #004d4d; font-size: 14px; margin: 0; }
        .footer { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 28px 32px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef; }
        .footer-text { color: #6c757d; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .footer a { color: #008b8b; text-decoration: none; }
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            body { padding: 12px !important; }
            .header, .content, .footer { padding: 24px 16px !important; }
            .code-value { font-size: 26px !important; letter-spacing: 0.15em !important; padding: 14px 10px !important; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <img src="https://usc1.contabostorage.com/385b0054b385440e928060e34f0e5b18:fileam-assets/fileam-logo.png" alt="Fileam" class="logo" width="140" height="48">
            <div class="header-subtitle">You're invited to join Fileam</div>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="greeting">Hello {{name}}!</div>
            <div class="message">You have been invited to join Fileam. Use the invitation code below when signing up or accepting the invitation in the app.</div>
            <div class="code-container">
                <div class="code-label">Your invitation code</div>
                <div class="code-value">{{invitationCode}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="expiry-info"><div class="expiry-text">This invitation expires on {{expiryDate}}</div></div>
            <div class="cta-note">
                <p class="security-text">If you did not expect this email, you can safely ignore it.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="message">
                <p>Best regards,<br>The Fileam Team</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <div class="footer-text">&copy; Fileam. All rights reserved. <a href="https://fileam.app">fileam.app</a></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
